            "review_title": "Review at Blue Whale Restaurant & Bar",
            "review_text": "Anand N\nDa Nang, Vietnam148 contributions\n0\nExcellent Restaurant with Superb Food and Stunning View of Beach\nAug 2018 • Business\nNice restaurant facing the My Khe Beach in Da Nang. I have been there for attending the events of some meetups.\nExcellent Aura and especially the Top House of the restaurant, where you can view the remarkable view of Beach.\nVegetarian Food is also available but the place is known for Sea Food.\nI am a Vegetarian, and believe me the food served was good.\nThe staff has less hold over English, so some issues come.\n\nOtherwise, the taste, quality, ambience and overall ranking of the restaurant is excellent. \n\nGo and feel the aura of this Restaurant.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 28, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
